  "raw_html": "<button type='button' role='link' class='btn btn-link p-0 text-start' id='link_3' aria-label=\" N. Manoharan, Etc. versus The Administrative Officer and Another pdf\"  class='noToken' href='#' onclick=javascript:open_pdf('3','2026','2026_2_596_609','2026INSC143'); ><font size='4'> <strong>N. MANOHARAN, ETC.<span class='fst-italic'> versus </span>THE ADMINISTRATIVE OFFICER AND ANOTHER </strong>- <span class='escrText'>[2026] 2 S.C.R. 596</span><span class='ncDisplay'>2026 INSC 143</span><input type='hidden' id='cnr' value=ESCR010000572026></button></font><br><strong>Coram : PANKAJ MITHAL<sup style=\"color: #268e97;font-size: 22px;top: 0;\" class=\"tooltip-sup\" data-tooltip=\"Author\">*</sup>, SARASA VENKATANARAYANA BHATTI</strong><br> Issue for Consideration Whether the employees of Heavy Water Plant, Department of Atomic Energy, Government of India, Tuticorin (&ldquo;HWP&rdquo;) are covered by the provisions of the Payment of Gratuity Act, 1972. Headnotes&dagger; Atomic Energy Act, 1962 &ndash; CCS (Pension) Rules, 1972 &ndash; s.2(e) &ndash; Retired employees of HWP employees governed by the CCS (Pension) Rules, 1972 claimed higher gratuity benefits under the PG Act &ndash; Controlling Authority held that the provisions of the PG Act are attracted to the employees of HWP, and directed to pay the difference of<br><strong class='caseDetailsTD' ><span style='color:#212F3D' > Decision Date :</span><font color='green'> 11-02-2026</font><span style='color:#212F3D' > | Case No :</span><font color='green'> CIVIL APPEAL No. 1513/2026</font><span style='color:#212F3D' > | Disposal Nature :</span><font color='green'> Dismissed</font>   <span style='color:#212F3D' > |  Bench :</span><font color='green'> 2 Judges</font></strong><div class='row my-1 mt-2 border bg-light'><div class='col-auto'><a href='#' class='btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm my-1' onclick=open_splitview('3','2026','2026_2_596_609','2026INSC143','S')><i <i class='fas fa-columns me-2'></i>Split view</a></div><div class='col-auto'><a href='#' class='btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm my-1' onclick=open_splitview('3','2026','2026_2_596_609','2026INSC143','H'); ><i class='fas fa-file-alt me-2'></i>HTML view</a></div><div class='col-auto'><a href='#' class='btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm my-1' onclick=open_flip('3','2026','2026_2_596_609','2026INSC143');><i class='fas fa-book-open me-2' ></i>Flip view</a></div><div class='col-auto'><a href='#' class='btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm my-1' onclick=open_pdf('3','2026','2026_2_596_609','2026INSC143','N'); ><i class='fas fa-file-pdf me-2'></i>PDF</a></div></div>",
